<title>UK: Lehman co-head of European investment banking dies.</title>
<headline>Lehman co-head of European investment banking dies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said on Monday that Bruno Gabriele, a managing director and co-head of European Investment Banking died in a motor accident on Saturday.</p>
<p>&quot;Bruno Gabriele was a truly exceptional banker, colleague and friend,&quot; Richard Fuld, Jr, Lehman chairman and chief executive said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6176</p>
